<h2>Shipping</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Free shipping</strong> on all orders over <%= h.money(50) %>.</li>
  <li>A flat <%= h.money(5.99) %> delivery fee applies to smaller orders.</li>
  <li>Orders are prepared within 1–2 business days and usually arrive within 3–5 business days.</li>
  <li>Every plant is hand-packed in protective, eco-friendly packaging.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Our Happy Plant Guarantee</h2>
<p>If your plant arrives damaged or unhealthy, contact us within <strong>30 days</strong> with a photo and your order number. We will send a replacement or issue a full refund — whichever you prefer.</p>
<h2>Returns</h2>
<p>Unopened accessories can be returned within 30 days. Because plants are living products, we cannot accept returns of healthy plants due to a change of mind, but we are always happy to help with care advice.</p>
<h2>Cancellations</h2>
<p>You can cancel an order from your account while it is still <em>pending</em>. Once it is being prepared, please contact us and we will do our best to help.</p>
